      "instance_name": "meme_format",
      "label": "Meme Format",
      "description": "The image follows a common meme format: a person with an intense expression overlaid with text that provides context or a punchline. This format is widely used on social media to convey humor, satire, or commentary. Recognizing this format requires knowledge of internet meme culture and conventions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
